# ── EAS only (B8, D459) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything below is tracked in git but is not part of the app: design
# captures, exports, run artifacts and tooling. EAS reads this file INSTEAD of
# .gitignore, which is why the lines above are a copy of it. Nothing in
# src/, convex/, assets/ or app.json reads from these folders.

